# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Meta-Pro frontend environment (Vite)
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. For production, set these in
# Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the deployed FastAPI backend (Render). The app appends
# `/generate/stream` to this value (see src/services/api.ts) and normalizes
# it to the API root, so EITHER form works:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<service-name>.onrender.com
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<service-name>.onrender.com/api
# Both resolve to https://<service-name>.onrender.com/api (the backend serves
# its routes under /api). When unset, calls go to the local `/api` Vite dev
# proxy (see frontend/vite.config.ts).
# Replace with your actual Render service URL:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://meta-pro-backend.onrender.com/api
